Usage: xnvme <command> [<args>]

Where <command> is one of:

  list             | List devices on the system
  enum             | Enumerate devices on the system
  scan             | Scan for devices without opening them
  info             | Retrieve derived information for given device

See 'xnvme <command> --help' for the description of [<args>]
See 'xnvme --version' for the library version and the revision it was built from

xNVMe - Cross-platform NVMe utility -- ver: {major: 0, minor: 7, patch: 5, vcs: 'v0.7.5-600-ga11f56fa'}
